    "en": {
      "trackName": "Crown Tennis - Ping Pong",
      "description": "Crown Tennis is a retro ping pong game built for Apple Watch, with offline solo play and online multiplayer matches.\n\nTurn the Digital Crown to control your paddle, feel every rally with haptics, and enjoy vivid particle effects with a dynamic parallax background powered by the watch’s gyroscope.\n\nPlay quick matches anytime: practice offline against the computer, or jump into online multiplayer to challenge other players. Improve your stats and unlock awards as you climb through three difficulty levels.\n\nFeatures:\n• Digital Crown controls designed for Apple Watch\n• Online multiplayer matches\n• Haptics, particle effects, and arcade-style presentation\n• Dynamic parallax background using gyroscope motion\n• 3 difficulty modes\n• Player stats and 14 unlockable awards\n• Offline solo play against the computer\n• Optional Pro purchase for extra paddle colors\n\nWhether you call it ping pong, table tennis, or arcade tennis, Crown Tennis brings a fast, tactile sports game to your wrist.",
      "releaseNotes": "Multiplayer support and new iPhone app.\nBug fixes and improvements.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/crown-tennis-ping-pong/id6743130287?uo=4",
      "formattedPrice": "Free",
